{"Component function is declared 'function TwoFactor(...)' while the file exports default BackupCode - should be renamed to BackupCode for clarity": 0.2977895140647888, "Backup code input should normalize by trimming whitespace and handling case sensitivity since crypto.randomBytes generates lowercase hex": 0.5067160725593567, "Object URL created with URL.createObjectURL is not revoked when component unmounts or modal closes, causing potential memory leak": 0.5049369931221008, "Used backup code is marked as null but nulls are not filtered before re-encrypting, causing array to accumulate nulls and potentially all codes becoming null without DB being set to null": 0.7376787066459656, "When encoding/decoding backup codes, ensure array shape and types are consistent (string[])": 0.30599555373191833, "Server-side disabling using backup code clears all codes instead of removing only the used code - inconsistent with provider behavior": 0.2819715738296509, "replaceAll usage may not be compatible with older Node versions - consider using .split('-').join('') for better compatibility": 0.05452333763241768, "Server-side validation needed to strip dashes and check backup code length equals 10": 0.5196648836135864, "tabIndex={-1} on password visibility toggle removes it from tab order - ensure keyboard users can still toggle password visibility": 0.5645467638969421, "Missing tests for backup code usage during sign-in flow": 0.07234853506088257, "Missing tests for backup code usage during disable flow": 0.027720727026462555, "Missing test to verify same backup code cannot be reused": 0.1073482483625412, "No explicit rate limiting for backup code attempts to prevent brute force attacks": 0.5492361783981323, "When all backup codes are used, DB should be set to null instead of keeping empty/null-filled array": 0.6378652453422546}